{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Derivative","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设实函数 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 在实数 <span class=\"math inline\">x</span> 的某个邻域内有定义。若有限极限</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nf'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}h\n</div>\n<p>存在，称 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">x</span> 处可导（differentiable），<span class=\"math inline\">f'(x)</span> 称为导数（derivative）。它表示函数在该点的瞬时变化率（instantaneous rate of change）。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实数</td>\n<td>real number</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导数</td>\n<td>derivative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极限</td>\n<td>limit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻域</td>\n<td>neighborhood</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"calc.derivative.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.derivative","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"导数"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Derivative","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设实函数 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 在实数 <span class=\"math inline\">x</span> 的某个邻域内有定义。若有限极限</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nf'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}h\n</div>\n<p>存在，称 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">x</span> 处可导（differentiable），<span class=\"math inline\">f'(x)</span> 称为导数（derivative）。它表示函数在该点的瞬时变化率（instantaneous rate of change）。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实数</td>\n<td>real number</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导数</td>\n<td>derivative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极限</td>\n<td>limit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻域</td>\n<td>neighborhood</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"calc.derivative.main","legacy